{
  "schema_version": "1.7.0",
  "id": "USN-8795-1",
  "summary": "openjdk-17 vulnerabilities",
  "details": "Kai Aizen discovered that the Networking component of OpenJDK 17 did not\ncorrectly handle user authentication. A remote attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to leak sensitive information. (CVE-2026-61308)\n\nIt was discovered that the JSSE component of OpenJDK 17 did not correctly\nhandle user authentication. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue\nto cause a denial of service. (CVE-2026-70907)\n\nIt was discovered that the Security component of OpenJDK 17 did not\ncorrectly handle user authentication. A remote attacker could possibly use\nthis issue to leak sensitive information. (CVE-2026-60589)",
